stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle

  Idle --> LoadContext: user_message / scene_changed / observation
  LoadContext --> LoadCapabilities: SceneReader / ArtifactReader
  LoadCapabilities --> BuildOrLoadTopology: DeviceSpecReader / CapabilityIndexer

  BuildOrLoadTopology --> TopologyValid: cached topology valid
  BuildOrLoadTopology --> RebuildTopology: cache miss or revision mismatch
  RebuildTopology --> TopologyValid: TopologyBuilder + InterfaceCompiler
  RebuildTopology --> TopologyNeedsReview: low-confidence inferred edges
  TopologyNeedsReview --> WaitingForUser: question_set / approval_required
  WaitingForUser --> BuildOrLoadTopology: user confirms or revises

  TopologyValid --> ClassifyIntent: topology_summary ready
  ClassifyIntent --> ResolveSlots: structured intent

  ResolveSlots --> SceneQuery: intent = scene_query
  ResolveSlots --> ParameterFill: intent = parameter_fill
  ResolveSlots --> TopologyDiagnosis: intent = topology_diagnosis
  ResolveSlots --> ProcessCompile: intent = process_config
  ResolveSlots --> BehaviorGraphCompile: intent = simulation_plan
  ResolveSlots --> RuntimeDiagnosis: intent = runtime_diagnosis
  ResolveSlots --> ScenarioCompare: intent = scenario_compare
  ResolveSlots --> RuntimeControl: intent = control

  SceneQuery --> EmitResult: diagnostic_report

  ParameterFill --> ValidateArtifact: ParameterExtractor + ParameterBinder
  TopologyDiagnosis --> ValidateArtifact: diagnostic_report / edge patch
  ProcessCompile --> SignalCompile: ProcessEdgePlanner
  SignalCompile --> BehaviorGraphCompile: SignalRoutePlanner + EventBusBuilder
  BehaviorGraphCompile --> ValidateArtifact: BehaviorGraphBuilder + PolicyLibrary
  RuntimeDiagnosis --> ValidateArtifact: TraceAnalyzer + RepairPlanner
  ScenarioCompare --> ValidateArtifact: ScenarioGenerator + MetricsReader
  RuntimeControl --> EmitResult: pause / resume / cancel result

  ValidateArtifact --> RepairArtifact: blocking validation error and attempts < 2
  RepairArtifact --> ValidateArtifact: repaired candidate artifact
  ValidateArtifact --> WaitingForUser: approval_required or unresolved assumptions
  ValidateArtifact --> StagePatch: validation passed

  StagePatch --> ApplyPatch: auto-apply allowed
  StagePatch --> WaitingForUser: destructive or low-confidence patch
  ApplyPatch --> EmitResult: PatchApplier + AuditLogger
  EmitResult --> Idle

  RuntimeDiagnosis --> PauseRuntime: repair requires live-state change
  PauseRuntime --> ApplyPatch: safe point reached
  ApplyPatch --> ResumeRuntime: repair targets active run
  ResumeRuntime --> EmitResult

  ValidateArtifact --> Failed: blocking error and attempts exhausted
  Failed --> EmitResult: explain failure and next action

  Idle --> [*]
